      "detail": "One four-stage c822 composition,308.218726s,2942/6000localRPC,one real local keeper harvest. Forty wrapper invocations are8backups+30observations+init+barrier, not40tests; six ordinary backups/three healthy observations are clearly separated from incidents/refusals. No old component body is rerun.",
