    },
    {
      "detail": "Receipt-cycle degraded at ready+252.528747; accepted fresh health at+264.219904,11.691162s later. Existing check schedule7030->7275 gives245s<=300maximum. Existing deadline-aware poll_delay explains the next evaluation; docs expressly avoid a secondfull240s wait, unrecorded exact _poll_clock/sleep reconstruction, continuous-price proof or an operatingSLA.",
